diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index f77bf1c..89845ff 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,3 +6,17 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 #
 ```
+
+## OS3 Stock/Lineage Hybrid Boot Validation
+
+The OS3.0.9.0.VNQCNXM vendor image must not be combined with unmodified
+Lineage system_ext property contexts. Both partitions declare
+`persist.vendor.pco5.radio.ctrl` and `vendor.camera.aux.packagelist` as prefixes.
+Android's property trie rejects both duplicates, including the camera entry
+whose SELinux label is identical. `PropertyInit()` then aborts before ADB starts.
+Permissive SELinux and another data format do not resolve this failure.
+
+Use [the hybrid validation and repair tool](tools/HYBRID_BOOT.md) when packaging
+the hybrid. It keeps the stock vendor rules and removes only the two audited
+system_ext duplicates in a staging copy. It does not alter the shared MTK or
+Lineage policy, the source-only device build, or an existing ROM package.
